{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decades after human extinction, robots have abandoned the human form.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world of monochromatic pixel art, this is a 2D adventure of robots resisting regression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quiet, monochromatic pixel art</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration by moving between a robot's &quot;Kokoro&quot; and the outside world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Estimated playtime: 60-120 minutes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple mouse-only controls.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A newly created small robot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Its purpose is to research and develop the &quot;evolution&quot; of robots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What does it take to create a more advanced robot?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the space of a robot's &quot;Kokoro&quot; to find new ideas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the light of hints gained from conversations with other robots to show you the way forward.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game does not include combat, flashy action, or character progression elements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features no BGM, consisting only of sound effects for a quiet exploration experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game contains themes of suicide.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4022520?t=1774393962","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022520/a6679abbff37f085f24526e924d3de5a03283cba/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774393962","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022520/4558df3ff11825b31098c8ff0072f2a6a90a9313/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774393962","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022520/4558df3ff11825b31098c8ff0072f2a6a90a9313/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774393962","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game contains symbolic depictions of self-harm involving non-human characters. These scenes are used as narrative metaphors to explore philosophical themes and do not depict realistic human death or injury. There are no depictions of sexual acts, sexual violence, or drug/alcohol abuse."},"demos":[{"appid":4238840,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decades after human extinction, robots have abandoned the human form.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world of monochromatic pixel art, this is a 2D adventure of robots resisting regression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quiet, monochromatic pixel art</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration by moving between a robot's &quot;Kokoro&quot; and the outside world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Estimated playtime: 60-120 minutes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple mouse-only controls.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A newly created small robot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Its purpose is to research and develop the &quot;evolution&quot; of robots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What does it take to create a more advanced robot?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the space of a robot's &quot;Kokoro&quot; to find new ideas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the light of hints gained from conversations with other robots to show you the way forward.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game does not include combat, flashy action, or character progression elements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features no BGM, consisting only of sound effects for a quiet exploration experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game contains themes of suicide.</p></li></ul>","developers":["mori"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022520/71fa66744a1964b40ab073cc0303f4e3a74d044e/header.jpg?t=1774393962","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4022520/1912848284/424370b1d0a66e0653c59d7821f49e6e1849b434/1757940090/dash_av1.mpd?t=1768042923","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4022520/1912848284/424370b1d0a66e0653c59d7821f49e6e1849b434/1757940090/dash_h264.mpd?t=1768042923","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4022520/1912848284/424370b1d0a66e0653c59d7821f49e6e1849b434/1757940090/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1768042923","id":257198014,"name":"trailer_1st","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257198014/9b091152cd3051019540e9c24856db55c4d428d4/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1768042923"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4022520/917918920/cf1ab971a21e70fdcf09fc12106116e934f54c6c/1768042733/dash_av1.mpd?t=1768042923","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4022520/917918920/cf1ab971a21e70fdcf09fc12106116e934f54c6c/1768042733/dash_h264.mpd?t=1768042923","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video